{"articleNo":"491820","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=491820&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 대학연합 OPIc 여름방학 이벤트(7~8월 적용)","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2024.07.03","hit":"4498","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQdkhpALgRwJYFMA2ARAigDwEFND4A7Ad1woBMAzVAOgCsAHAcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">여름방학 7~8월에만 대학연합 연합교 재학생 대상으로&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">대학연합 OPIc&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">프로모션을 진행하게 되었습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">기존 대학연합 OPIc 의 경우&nbsp;연 1회만 혜택을 적용할 수 있었지만,&nbsp;이번에는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">프로모션으로 준비하여 대학연합 OPIc 평가를 추가 접수 및 응시하실 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; 하기 안내된 프로모션 페이지에서 접수를 진행하는 경우, 동일한 대학연합 OPIc 이지만 별도 횟수 제어에 해당되지 않고 이용 가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; 이미 대학연합의 연 1회를 사용하셨거나 나중에 사용 예정인 분들도 횟수와 상관없이 프로모션 평가는 접수(응시) 가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.5; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inhe